   "wikipedia": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ain%27t_Done_with_the_Blues",
   "resumo_en": "Ain't Done with the Blues is the twentieth studio album by American blues musician Buddy Guy. It was released on July 30, 2025 (Guy's 89th birthday), via Silvertone/RCA Records. The recording sessions took place at Blackbird Studio and The Switchyard in Nashville, at Esplanade Studios in New Orleans, at Solmonie Studio, and at Sunset Sound in Hollywood. Produced by Tom Hambridge, it features guest appearances from Christone \"Kingfish\" Ingram, Joe Bonamassa, Joe Walsh, Peter Frampton and The Blind Boys of Alabama.\nThe album won the Grammy Award for Best Traditional Blues Album on February 1, 2026, at the 68th Annual Grammy Awards.",
